# Gitignored files copied from the repository root into every new Conductor
# workspace. See https://conductor.build/docs/reference/worktreeinclude
#
# Committed on purpose. `.env` is not in git and must not be - it holds the
# database password. What is committed is the instruction to copy it, never the
# values.
#
# Without this a fresh workspace has no `.env`, so compose has no credentials
# and the database comes up empty.
.env
